/*
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * K&A Client Diaries — Index page template
 * Docs/client-diaries-build-spec.md — built from
 * Prototypes/client-diaries-index-v1.html (approved by Suraj,
 * 10 Aug 2026, spec v2.0).
 *
 * Replaces sections/ka-diary-coming-soon.liquid, which is fully
 * retired per spec §0 — not reused as a component anywhere here.
 *
 * Sections: Nav -> Masthead -> Intro Statement -> Featured Diary ->
 * Browse Bar -> Diary Grid -> Share Your Story -> Appointment CTA
 * (reused ka-appointment) -> Footer.
 *
 * Data model: entries are Shopify blog articles in the blog with
 * handle "client-diaries" (see ka-diary-featured.liquid / ka-diary-
 * grid.liquid section settings — "Client Diaries blog handle",
 * default "client-diaries", overridable per-section in the theme
 * editor if that blog is ever renamed). See sections/ka-diary-
 * featured.liquid header comment for the full data-model writeup
 * and the metafield/metaobject definition gaps that must be created
 * manually in Shopify Admin before any entry (including Simran's)
 * can go live.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 */
